From 2400ecc0c223af7dfe1dd7baafebdb31770f755f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suharvest <suharvest@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 14:28:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/30] feat(int4-plugin): opt-in BF16 output dtype
 (output_dtype attribute)

Int4GroupwiseGemmPlugin gains an optional 'output_dtype' field (nvinfer1
DataType enum as int32). Absent / kHALF -> legacy FP16 path, byte-identical.
kBF16 routes getOutputDataTypes, supportsFormatCombination(out), and enqueue
to the BF16-output GEMV/GEMM kernels. Activation input stays FP16 in both
paths; only the output dtype differs. Attribute is serialized so a
deserialized engine restores the opt-in path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013XsZpWRubKjuZDyZqx3q4E

